The project aims at the restoration of grasslands that were formerly deforested for the purpose of cattle grazing activities.
The project was designed for the following objectives: 
- Greenhouse gas removals;
- Pedagogic activities on carbon sequestration;
- Preservation of biodiversity;
- Local development

